    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνορύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόρμ-ττω</span></b> , pf.
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνορώρυγμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					468
				</span></i>
			:—<i>dig up</i> what has been buried, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀστέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				113
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					602
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					372
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cont.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τάφον</span>
			<i>dig up, break open, destroy</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				16.26
			</span></i>.</div>
